    "title": "Color Up - Color By Number",
    "description": "Introducing Color Up: An Easy, Relaxing Color by Number Game.\r\n\r\nColoring in Color Up is both effortless and rewarding. We\u2019ve designed this game to reduce the frustration of complex, lengthy sessions with tiny, hard-to-find color areas. Instead, you can fully immerse yourself in the art of drawing and enjoy a relaxing, joyful coloring experience. \r\n\r\nWith Color Up, creating beautiful images has never been easier. \r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\ud83e\udd8bDiverse range of images: animals, mandalas, room interiors, nature scenes, big-eyed Cartoon, and portraits of women.\r\n\ud83e\udd8bConstant stream of fresh content: Discover new and exciting pictures each day as the collection continues to grow.\r\n\ud83e\udd8bShare completed artwork with friends and family for free, spreading joy and showcasing your creativity.\r\n\r\nEnjoy yourself in the relaxing world of Color Up, express your creativity, and enjoy endless hours of soothing coloring fun. Download Color Up now and let your imagination run wild!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing Color Up: An Easy, Relaxing Color by Number Game.<br><br>Coloring in Color Up is both effortless and rewarding. We\u2019ve designed this game to reduce the frustration of complex, lengthy sessions with tiny, hard-to-find color areas. Instead, you can fully immerse yourself in the art of drawing and enjoy a relaxing, joyful coloring experience. <br><br>With Color Up, creating beautiful images has never been easier. <br><br>Features:<br>\ud83e\udd8bDiverse range of images: animals, mandalas, room interiors, nature scenes, big-eyed Cartoon, and portraits of women.<br>\ud83e\udd8bConstant stream of fresh content: Discover new and exciting pictures each day as the collection continues to grow.<br>\ud83e\udd8bShare completed artwork with friends and family for free, spreading joy and showcasing your creativity.<br><br>Enjoy yourself in the relaxing world of Color Up, express your creativity, and enjoy endless hours of soothing coloring fun. Download Color Up now and let your imagination run wild!",
